  <section class="content-section">
    <h2>About Laguna BelAir 4</h2>
    <p>Laguna BelAir 4 is a residential subdivision located in Brgy. Don Jose, City of Santa Rosa, Laguna. The community is managed by the Homeowners Association to ensure a safe, peaceful, and organized environment for all residents. The village promotes cooperation, responsible homeownership, and active participation in community activities and programs.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- Community Living -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <h2>Community Living</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Safe and secured residential environment</li>
      <li>Guarded entrance and security personnel</li>
      <li>Clean and orderly surroundings</li>
      <li>Active homeowners participation</li>
      <li>Peaceful neighborhood atmosphere</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- Village Facilities -->
